 finally fights back from range. Three creature types that used to just circle you now spit acid at your cruiser. To make that manageable, Space pauses the whole fight, you can fire straight from the helm, and messages no longer vanish for good. Your save from 0.24.0 loads, but it's missing two parts. Fire control and the periscope now depend on two real modules, the Fire Computer and the Periscope. Old saves don't have them, so the command view won't compute firing solutions and the pe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T20:47:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939356","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4943770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T21:47:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T21:47:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4943770":"2026-10-25T21:47:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4943770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T21:47:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T21:47:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5199590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T21:47:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T21:47:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
